{"4555580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Restoraether", "steam_appid": 4555580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5039100], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restoraether is a cozy magical survival crafting game where you explore the isles of magic, mysteriously abandoned by their powerful Mage inhabitants, and restore the balance of aethers to bring magic back to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555580/extras/56ff1990f008de25ff66eec9c1cbb438.avif?t=1787936875\" width=488 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey across unique islands left mysteriously abandoned by the Mages who once called them home. Venture out into the dangerous Miasma in the safety of your lantern's light to uncover forgotten places, lost knowledge, and the secrets behind a place where magic has faded away. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555580/extras/05e2e8bbf76cfc72c8830abafea92389.poster.avif?t=1787936875\" width=1024 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555580/extras/05e2e8bbf76cfc72c8830abafea92389.webm?t=1787936875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555580/extras/05e2e8bbf76cfc72c8830abafea92389.mp4?t=1787936875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555580/extras/f9da720f8ae6b0dc7768a59f594cfcee.avif?t=1787936875\" width=488 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a cozy home where you can rest, craft, and prepare for your next outing. Master Alchemy, Herbalism, Transmutation, and other magical arts, learn new spells, and befriend helpful elemental spirits as your knowledge of Aether grows. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555580/extras/9566d5fb3b083cc93e9ad7d706b5b66c.poster.avif?t=1787936875\" width=1024 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555580/extras/9566d5fb3b083cc93e9ad7d706b5b66c.webm?t=1787936875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555580/extras/9566d5fb3b083cc93e9ad7d706b5b66c.mp4?t=1787936875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555580/extras/54854f139f9b53566590896e2af8dc74.avif?t=1787936875\" width=488 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The islands long to breathe with magic once more, but their ancient balance has been lost. Through patience, discovery, and your growing mastery of magic, you'll rekindle the magic woven into the land, dispelling the Miasma and restoring Aether to these magical islands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555580/extras/3f2c6d6be30126f5176337b5679edb0a.poster.avif?t=1787936875\" width=1024 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555580/extras/3f2c6d6be30126f5176337b5679edb0a.webm?t=1787936875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555580/extras/3f2c6d6be30126f5176337b5679edb0a.mp4?t=1787936875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival: Upkeep your health and hunger while avoiding prolonged exposure to the deadly miasma.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build shelter: A home to protect you from the miasma</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magical crafting: Conjure items, brew potions, unlock new materials through transmutation, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance the aethers: extract elemental aethers from resources to restore magic to the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spirits: befriend helpful elemental spirits that will help automate your tasks.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restoraether is a cozy magical survival crafting game where you explore the isles of magic, mysteriously abandoned by their powerful Mage inhabitants, and restore the balance of aethers to bring magic back to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555580/extras/56ff1990f008de25ff66eec9c1cbb438.avif?t=1787936875\" width=488 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey across unique islands left mysteriously abandoned by the Mages who once called them home. Venture out into the dangerous Miasma in the safety of your lantern's light to uncover forgotten places, lost knowledge, and the secrets behind a place where magic has faded away. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555580/extras/05e2e8bbf76cfc72c8830abafea92389.poster.avif?t=1787936875\" width=1024 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555580/extras/05e2e8bbf76cfc72c8830abafea92389.webm?t=1787936875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555580/extras/05e2e8bbf76cfc72c8830abafea92389.mp4?t=1787936875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555580/extras/f9da720f8ae6b0dc7768a59f594cfcee.avif?t=1787936875\" width=488 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a cozy home where you can rest, craft, and prepare for your next outing. Master Alchemy, Herbalism, Transmutation, and other magical arts, learn new spells, and befriend helpful elemental spirits as your knowledge of Aether grows. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555580/extras/9566d5fb3b083cc93e9ad7d706b5b66c.poster.avif?t=1787936875\" width=1024 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555580/extras/9566d5fb3b083cc93e9ad7d706b5b66c.webm?t=1787936875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555580/extras/9566d5fb3b083cc93e9ad7d706b5b66c.mp4?t=1787936875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"http